  "body": "Experience luxury living at Long Bay Drive, managed by a trusted, locally owned developer with years of experience delivering exceptional quality. \r\n\r\nPerched high on Long Bay Drive, this boutique collection features quality homes built to the highest standards.\r\n\r\n\r\nHighlights:\r\n\r\n* 3 bedrooms, including a spacious master\r\n* 3 bathrooms\r\n* 10 years master builder warranty\r\n* Dedicated 2 car parkings\r\n* Sun-filled, open-plan living spaces that radiate warmth and style\r\n* Enjoy sweeping views of Rangitoto Island and the Hauraki Gulf, just a 5-minute stroll to Long Bay Beach. \r\n\r\nLocated on Auckland's North Shore, Torbay offers easy access to shopping, parks, schools, and transport, with the motorway only a short drive away.\r\n\r\nEvery detail has been thoughtfully considered-from fully fitted wardrobes to designer lighting-so you can move in and start enjoying the lifestyle immediately.\r\n\r\n\r\nAct quickly-offers are being sought now! Call Ming today to arrange a viewing.",
